@startuml
skinparam maxMessageSize 150
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

title Проверка прав при выполнении бизнес-операции (gRPC)

actor "Пользователь\n(Frontend)" as User
participant "API Gateway\n(BFF)" as BFF
participant "Board Service\n(PEP)" as Board
participant "Security IAM\n(PDP)" as IAM
database "Board Database\n(PostgreSQL)" as BoardDB

User -> BFF: DELETE /api/workspaces/10/boards/555\n(JWT Токен)
activate BFF

BFF -> BFF: Валидация JWT\nИзвлечение UserId
BFF -> Board: DELETE /boards/555\nHeader: X-User-Id, X-Workspace-Id=10
activate Board
deactivate BFF

note over Board: Срабатывает [HasPermission("boards:delete")]

Board -> IAM: gRPC: CheckAccess(UserId, WorkspaceId=10, "boards:delete")
activate IAM

note over IAM: IAM извлекает роли пользователя\nи проверяет матрицу прав

IAM --> Board: gRPC Response: { IsAllowed: true }
deactivate IAM

opt Если IsAllowed == true
    Board -> BoardDB: DELETE FROM Boards WHERE Id=555 AND WorkspaceId=10
    activate BoardDB
    BoardDB --> Board: OK
    deactivate BoardDB
    
    Board --> User: 200 OK / 204 No Content
else Если IsAllowed == false
    Board --> User: 403 Forbidden
end

deactivate Board

@enduml